# --------------------------------------------------------
# POSTGRESQL DATABASE (Rekomendasi Utama: Data Permanen & Anti Hilang Saat Redeploy)
# --------------------------------------------------------
# Sangat disarankan untuk cloud deployment (Render, Railway, Fly.io, VPS, Supabase, Neon).
# Anda dapat membuat database PostgreSQL gratis dalam 1 menit di:
# 1. https://neon.tech (Gratis serverless PostgreSQL)
# 2. https://supabase.com (Gratis managed PostgreSQL)
# 3. Railway / Render PostgreSQL add-on
#
# Cukup salin connection string URI ke variabel di bawah:
# Contoh format:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://neondb_owner:password@ep-xyz.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
DATABASE_URL=

